/**
 * STRATEGY FOR PRIMARY TAB:
 * 1. Minimalist layout (no heavy tables or buttons).
 * 2. High text-to-HTML ratio.
 * 3. Use standard system fonts.
 * 4. No external images or tracking pixels (Disable tracking in Resend).
 */
